  "body": "In https://github.com/whatwg/dom/commit/8f812e6b16ba31270ba60568fb0bdbb78949348e I found it unclear how to link to the URL specification. It should be `<a spec=url>URL</a>` according to the documentation, but that creates an internal link.\n\nFurthermore, it ended up adding `<li><a href=\"#concept-document-type\">dfn for Document</a><span>, in §4.5</span>` for something that should really be labeled \"type\" I think.\n\n@tabatkins, ideas?\n",
